<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-UHISPANK TO RAISE PROFIT FORECAST.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-UHISPANK TO RAISE PROFIT FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank said on Monday that it would release a revised, higher profit estimate for 1997 at the beginning of July.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that it would revise its present 105.8 million kroons profit estimate when the final costs of a bank merger with Pohja-Eesti Pank are clear.</p>
<p>Uhispank earlier on Monday told a news conference that its first quarter results show it has a good chance of meeting its annual profit forecast but it said it will not raise it.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
